Homepage: https://github.com/roge-rm/ParrotMetric
Description: parametric 3D modeller for 3D printing
 Draw sketches with constraints and dimensions, then extrude, revolve,
 fillet, chamfer, shell and cut them into parts. Every step stays in the
 history, so changing an early one updates everything after it.
 .
 Exports STL, 3MF, OBJ, STEP and IGES, and imports and repairs STL, 3MF and
 OBJ meshes as well as STEP and IGES solids.
